    <node id="Pregnancy">
      <data key="d0">Pregnancy</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Pregnancy can be affected by cancer treatment; measures are necessary to prevent or plan pregnancies.&lt;SEP&gt;Pregnancy is a biological state where a woman carries a developing fetus in her uterus.&lt;SEP&gt;Pregnancy refers to the state of carrying a developing fetus within the female reproductive system, including considerations for planning and potential participation in clinical trials.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3fbf2f6a3c150687a59f814d94f1d150&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5fa7c7369d88ae71c842152510867223&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-705ff2bd04b2b58b98187f60f23a659e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-419f40f64b13b1b2d0fac3cfb9fde92a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-052101b592e186cce702983d2acc67e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7bdde77ad1be3ee9308db3c7703674b0</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764560428</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Alkaline Phosphatase">
      <data key="d0">Alkaline Phosphatase</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Alkaline phosphatase (ALP) is an enzyme in blood, high levels of which can indicate cancer spread to bone or liver.&lt;SEP&gt;Alkaline phosphatase (ALP) is an enzyme measured in blood, which can indicate bone or liver issues or pregnancy.&lt;SEP&gt;Alkaline phosphatase is an enzyme measured in liver function tests, indicating liver activity.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0bd86bf8fc82f14fa5f7f51d924514e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3fbf2f6a3c150687a59f814d94f1d150&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dea00cf063e8831db4919330d94b1f2a</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764560428</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Comprehensive Metabolic Panel">
      <data key="d0">Comprehensive Metabolic Panel</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">A CMP measures substances in blood and evaluates kidney and liver function among other health indicators.&lt;SEP&gt;A comprehensive metabolic panel (CMP) measures 14 substances in blood to evaluate kidney and liver function.&lt;SEP&gt;A group of 14 blood tests measuring blood sugar, calcium, electrolytes, liver, and kidney function.&lt;SEP&gt;A comprehensive metabolic panel (CMP) assesses substances in blood to evaluate kidney, liver, and overall metabolic health.&lt;SEP&gt;A comprehensive metabolic panel (CMP) measures important chemicals, proteins, and other substances in blood to assess health, including liver and kidney function, and detect signs of health problems.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-717174ace5855cc823d51c46c9a70648&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67015f3916810c4378b2ed269cc27f29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68217ea9e5382d1756c99b5152ea98db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dea00cf063e8831db4919330d94b1f2a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9fa573748870dc50a98a935843997c68&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0bd86bf8fc82f14fa5f7f51d924514e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3fbf2f6a3c150687a59f814d94f1d150&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0f15711706bc171fed17a7fab91b4b6</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764560428</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Lactate Dehydrogenase">
      <data key="d0">Lactate Dehydrogenase</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">LDH is an enzyme released from dying or rapidly growing cells, including tumor cells.&lt;SEP&gt;Lactate dehydrogenase (LDH) is an enzyme released from dying cells and tumor cells indicating tissue damage or growth.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9fa573748870dc50a98a935843997c68&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3fbf2f6a3c150687a59f814d94f1d150&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-69e63736c94b8b08a565c3d8679d3b57</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764560429</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Pregnancy Test">
      <data key="d0">Pregnancy Test</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">A test conducted before treatment to determine if a person can become pregnant, essential for those with ovaries.&lt;SEP&gt;A test conducted before cancer treatment to determine if a person who can become pregnant is pregnant.&lt;SEP&gt;A pregnancy test is administered before treatment to determine pregnancy status in women capable of conceiving.&lt;SEP&gt;A pregnancy test is performed before treatment if a woman can become pregnant.&lt;SEP&gt;A pregnancy test determines if a person can become pregnant before treatment begins.&lt;SEP&gt;A test to determine pregnancy status, relevant before certain treatments or procedures.&lt;SEP&gt;A pregnancy test is performed before cancer treatment to ensure safety for pregnant individuals or those potentially pregnant.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3fbf2f6a3c150687a59f814d94f1d150&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0bd86bf8fc82f14fa5f7f51d924514e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-717174ace5855cc823d51c46c9a70648&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67015f3916810c4378b2ed269cc27f29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5fa7c7369d88ae71c842152510867223&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7bdde77ad1be3ee9308db3c7703674b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-052101b592e186cce702983d2acc67e4</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764560429</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="X-ray">
      <data key="d0">X-ray</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">X-ray is an imaging technique that uses radiation to visualize the inside of the body, which MRI does not utilize.&lt;SEP&gt;X-ray uses radiation to create images of internal body structures.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3fbf2f6a3c150687a59f814d94f1d150&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ae40f53e9d867c255e1e6901f5cfb058&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-29c9b8b5fd2cd967c48522af79a9598f</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764560429</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Bone Scan">
      <data key="d0">Bone Scan</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">A nuclear imaging test that uses radioactive tracers to detect cancer spread to bones.&lt;SEP&gt;Uses radioactive tracers to detect cancer spread to bones.&lt;SEP&gt;A bone scan is a diagnostic test that detects cancer spread to bones using a radioactive tracer.&lt;SEP&gt;A bone scan uses a radiotracer injected into a vein to produce images of bones, helpful in detecting cancer spread to bone.&lt;SEP&gt;A bone scan uses a radiotracer to detect areas of bone damage, which may indicate cancer, injuries, or other health issues.&lt;SEP&gt;Bone scan involves a radiotracer to detect bone damage or disease, such as cancer or injury.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3fbf2f6a3c150687a59f814d94f1d150&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-975e540ddee1810d43caf8df4adcf205&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67e9c4dc95841db7d0af39e1267ae71b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aeafa486bfd320cdaa7811ad75777912&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0bd86bf8fc82f14fa5f7f51d924514e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a2778e34af702d49d5e70867726e14b2</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764560429</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Diagnosis">
      <data key="d0">Diagnosis</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Diagnosis is the comprehensive process of identifying illnesses or health conditions through clinical evaluation, laboratory tests, imaging, and procedures. It involves collecting and analyzing various types of diagnostic information such as patient history, physical examinations, laboratory tests (including blood, genetic, and tumor marker tests), imaging techniques, biopsies, and, in some cases, surgical procedures. The goal of diagnosis is to determine the presence, type, and extent of a disease or condition.

For specific diseases, the diagnostic process may include specialized methods. For example, diagnosing skin cancer involves evaluating patient history, conducting physical examinations, and performing skin biopsies, with additional imaging if necessary. Ovarian cancer diagnosis commonly incorporates tissue removal, biopsy, imaging, blood tests, and genetic testing to establish the cancer type and stage. Pancreatic cancer diagnosis relies on symptom assessments, physical exams, and imaging techniques. Prostate cancer is often diagnosed through prostate-specific antigen (PSA) blood tests, digital rectal exams, and imaging studies to detect the presence and determine the stage of the cancer.

In cases such as gliomas, diagnosis occurs after symptoms manifest, utilizing tests, physical exams, and surgical procedures. Similarly, anal cancer diagnosis involves confirming the disease through biopsy and imaging. Overall, diagnosis integrates multiple diagnostic modalities to accurately identify illnesses, guiding appropriate treatment options.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-da0bfe00946dcdff3a8a6fb3d73ce6e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dea00cf063e8831db4919330d94b1f2a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64f36a4a5be80c8fa51631db16e52b85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3fbf2f6a3c150687a59f814d94f1d150&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-717174ace5855cc823d51c46c9a70648&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9530f389987c13273449ab22a85170ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3821a6febf2d21784059ac62a6e659c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0fb70c1c798caae12ac2d64e61bcbad4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6232dd9ed168a1113955e7300645338b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67e9c4dc95841db7d0af39e1267ae71b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3958b5f7df8a8fc2661705e37dc1e06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b4da30dee72e228147daa825e4f5be72&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa14ecd19e2d721cb99ea9590f0ede3a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb36cedd3f66584d65304e58b668eeab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d47a420aa2acde1175ad95bf6dc2e664&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa5247d6b8c17e58ab315a0d641c7ad3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc89a92e9a97781ebca0db50abc34939&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96238b4b361e393ff452a09d1ce26154&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a0d4d6b091e033fd01aa721422b68ef5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0f15711706bc171fed17a7fab91b4b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b4d036ee5fd77783b9e7ddef3a8477ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8aa2c7020ce6e89888e81972588726e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4966a628b12ecec4187796598764cf23&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5bc83f5f4f3e29b7f0a6f4787c3ad83&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-97836a515d346931beb424ae40a89877&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8eae4d6dadf6a6fbd339efa4dec2172&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5846f51c2ca4fae54459ce9c50e3e820</data>
