    <node id="Radiation Oncologist">
      <data key="d0">Radiation Oncologist</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A radiation oncologist uses radiation therapy to treat cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;A doctor specializing in radiation treatment for cancer patients.&lt;SEP&gt;A radiation oncologist administers radiation therapy to treat breast cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;A radiation oncologist prescribes and plans radiation therapy to treat cancers, including bladder cancer.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-1e017cd4fd8af1ebbcb582a93fbfe1ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e74c94f9f2ff33172671e8742338c6d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dea00cf063e8831db4919330d94b1f2a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0fb70c1c798caae12ac2d64e61bcbad4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb41559e96b71d2bb4ea207c806e8d5f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9cc65c1c26b9e24bfb2c8c966f734a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ecc6c4bcd3cab65fa05ab5f3c55e528d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8ac9bf8f198bc5ad54fd1a7b843e810</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
