    <node id="Platinum-Based Chemotherapy">
      <data key="d0">Platinum-Based Chemotherapy</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Platinum-based chemotherapy is a recommended systemic therapy option to be used with radiation therapy for treating CSCC.&lt;SEP&gt;Platinum-based chemotherapy is a type of systemic therapy using platinum compounds to kill cancer cells, often combined with radiation.&lt;SEP&gt;Platinum-based chemotherapy involves medicines containing platinum, such as carboplatin, cisplatin, or oxaliplatin.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8ba71a5181f3814dffb21d3399441bea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b69d38fafe014cece3427bd0459ae42b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64895edc4d35c98b293c555e32022a37&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a9d0006f1c78fe4fa7bb74b756033104&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50c5e5d6c7a62da56b73abb9a3384301&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ec4d44b145ca896ff1216caa90ce5dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c622c677deca24391324ecd5f16ce4a3</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764560481</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Taxanes">
      <data key="d0">Taxanes</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Taxanes are a class of chemotherapy drugs like paclitaxel and docetaxel often combined with platinum-based drugs.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b69d38fafe014cece3427bd0459ae42b</data>
