    <node id="Tissue Sample">
      <data key="d0">Tissue Sample</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Samples of tissue are taken during biopsy or laparoscopy for laboratory testing to identify cancer cells.&lt;SEP&gt;A small portion of tumor removed during biopsy for laboratory analysis.&lt;SEP&gt;A tissue sample is a specimen collected from a tumor or organ for diagnostic and biomarker testing in glioma diagnosis.</data>
