      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Bladder cancer that has spread outside the bladder to other body parts like lymph nodes, bones, lungs, or liver.&lt;SEP&gt;An advanced stage where cancer has spread beyond the bladder to other parts of the body.</data>
