      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">The most common symptom of bladder cancer, indicating abnormal bleeding from the bladder.&lt;SEP&gt;A symptom indicating possible bladder or urinary tract issues.&lt;SEP&gt;A symptom of bladder cancer or other urinary problems.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-68217ea9e5382d1756c99b5152ea98db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13e723cb8b0af4bcf2f1b0fd37912cb2</data>
