    <node id="Smoking">
      <data key="d0">Smoking</data>
      <data key="d1">behavior</data>
      <data key="d2">Smoking is a widespread behavior involving the inhalation of tobacco or vaping products, which introduces carcinogenic substances into the body. It is well-established as a major health risk factor, significantly increasing the likelihood of developing multiple types of cancers, including bladder, lung, head and neck, and anal cancers. Specifically, smoking accounts for about half of bladder cancer cases, making it the greatest risk factor for this disease. The carcinogenic compounds in tobacco raise the risk of cancer by damaging cellular DNA and impairing immune function.

In addition to increasing cancer risk, smoking can interfere with the effectiveness of cancer treatments, leading to poorer health outcomes and increased treatment toxicity. It can also worsen respiratory health by impairing lung function and increasing respiratory complications. Smoking is associated with a range of health issues beyond cancer, including heightened risk for other cancers and lung problems. It often occurs alongside vaping, a related habit involving inhalation of vaporized substances.

Ceasing smoking has been shown to significantly reduce the risk of developing cancers, including bladder and anal cancers, and can improve responses to cancer treatments. Quitting smoking not only diminishes carcinogenic exposure but also enhances immune function, facilitating better overall health outcomes. As a lifestyle factor, smoking cessation is crucial for improving cancer prognosis and reducing the burden of smoking-related diseases.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7a890e27eba8c63d10f19b85a72fc14a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d609bd1a55d409470c55ad55e2d125d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-705ff2bd04b2b58b98187f60f23a659e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-33608457001e818e2b300adae9c6c0d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa251c48fc1fccfe45605a384f743662&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be6e1cb2fe11f4d9962741c30d446a69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ecc6c4bcd3cab65fa05ab5f3c55e528d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8aa2c7020ce6e89888e81972588726e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68217ea9e5382d1756c99b5152ea98db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9530f389987c13273449ab22a85170ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0bad5ee25cb854c10bdbc9d33b54a1a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf41d1c08e8df109ad214d831867a5d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28e4e845dfd1390f7f94cfb11bee1526&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a9d0006f1c78fe4fa7bb74b756033104&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9a7fe3b15f3289198c7114b44890dea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-08475506372bb4ce9ec1bd326caf0fe9</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
