    <node id="NSCLC">
      <data key="d0">NSCLC</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Non-small cell lung cancer (NSCLC) is the most common type of lung cancer, originating from airway lining cells.&lt;SEP&gt;NSCLC (non-small cell lung cancer) is a type of lung cancer discussed in the guidelines, with causes, risk factors, symptoms, and diagnosis methods described.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-bd06bc83e13e7562ce65d6eee1b6024f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ecc6c4bcd3cab65fa05ab5f3c55e528d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ef6586b896c47b361bf4f6aabb4c35d5</data>
