      <data key="d2">The NCCN.org/patientguidelines provides information and guidelines for patients regarding NSCLC.&lt;SEP&gt;NCCN.org/patientguidelines provides guidelines to help patients understand cancer care and make informed decisions.&lt;SEP&gt;A website hosting guidelines and information related to cancer and fertility preservation.&lt;SEP&gt;Website offering detailed information and guidelines for breast cancer patients.&lt;SEP&gt;Official website providing guidelines and information on head and neck cancers, including esophageal and mouth cancers.&lt;SEP&gt;A website URL linking to patient guidelines related to cancer care.</data>
