      <data key="d0">Esophagus wall</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The wall of the esophagus has four layers: mucosa, submucosa, muscularis propria, and tunica adventitia.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ecc6c4bcd3cab65fa05ab5f3c55e528d</data>
