    <node id="Genetic Counselor">
      <data key="d0">Genetic Counselor</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A genetic counselor is an expert trained in genetic diseases who helps interpret genetic test results and advise on testing decisions.&lt;SEP&gt;Genetic counselors help interpret genetic test results and assess inherited cancer risks.&lt;SEP&gt;A genetic counselor provides expert guidance on genetic testing for inherited cancer syndromes such as Lynch syndrome and FAP.&lt;SEP&gt;A genetic counselor interprets how family history impacts disease risk and treatment options, including cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;A genetic counselor is an expert who guides patients through genetic testing processes and interprets genetic test results for inherited cancer risk.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ae40f53e9d867c255e1e6901f5cfb058&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a890e27eba8c63d10f19b85a72fc14a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-925a474b4538dda470bfd817f9d9a17d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0fb70c1c798caae12ac2d64e61bcbad4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-789ec6c06f8c999ac21c89b085b3fdb7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-965e5a6bad03f2129a98be4373f99176&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dea00cf063e8831db4919330d94b1f2a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3958b5f7df8a8fc2661705e37dc1e06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-85e75e869fcfcb7c5431dbcdd532137f</data>
