    <node id="Imaging Test">
      <data key="d0">Imaging Test</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Imaging studies like ultrasound, CT scan, or MRI are employed to detect recurrence or metastasis.&lt;SEP&gt;Imaging tests like X-rays are used to investigate areas of the urinary tract when cancer is suspected but not found in initial tests.</data>
