    <node id="Intravesical Therapy">
      <data key="d0">Intravesical Therapy</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Intravesical therapy is a treatment involving the delivery of medication directly into the bladder to treat cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Treatment involving filling the bladder with liquid medication to destroy cancer cells.&lt;SEP&gt;Treatment involving instilling medicine directly into the bladder through a catheter to destroy cancer cells or prevent recurrence.&lt;SEP&gt;A treatment involving directly administering medication into the bladder to treat bladder cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Intravesical therapy involves placing cancer medicine directly into the bladder via a catheter.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a158766f46bf752d6cdfe95c92f14547&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13e723cb8b0af4bcf2f1b0fd37912cb2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0a584e54ffa22e1c25f839302bcd727&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2a44e885faf856aa579d824b3cd85e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dea00cf063e8831db4919330d94b1f2a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-541f1323a24c5990b4a6408e0c5442ab</data>
