      <data key="d0">Blood Urea Nitrogen</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">BUN is a waste product filtered by kidneys; high levels can indicate kidney dysfunction.&lt;SEP&gt;Blood urea nitrogen (BUN) is a waste product measured in blood tests to assess kidney function.</data>
