    <node id="Prostate">
      <data key="d0">Prostate</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">The prostate is a vital gland in the male reproductive system, roughly the size of a ping-pong ball. It is located deep inside the pelvis, beneath the bladder, and surrounds the urethra. The prostate plays a crucial role in male fertility by producing seminal fluid, which constitutes a significant component of semen. It contains muscular tissue that helps propel semen during ejaculation, facilitating the transport of sperm.

In addition to its reproductive functions, the prostate produces prostate-specific antigen (PSA), a protein that is important for semen liquefaction and serves as a key marker in detecting prostate health issues, including prostate cancer. The gland's proximity to the bladder and urethra makes it relevant in certain medical procedures, such as bladder surgeries, and it is frequently examined through imaging and biopsy techniques to diagnose conditions like prostate cancer and benign prostate enlargement.

Prostate cancer develops when abnormal cell growth occurs within the gland, sometimes leading to significant health concerns. The risk factors, progression, and treatment options for prostate cancer vary depending on its stage. The detection of increased PSA levels often prompts further investigation for potential malignancy. Besides cancer, the prostate is also susceptible to benign enlargement, which can impact urinary functions. Overall, the prostate is essential for reproductive health and is a focus of medical attention due to its susceptibility to various conditions, particularly cancer.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0fb70c1c798caae12ac2d64e61bcbad4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6d28b36fe82792dfb86e98ef76b3b04&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3c0f6d26f2f58ca13201c1a90b0a180&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa251c48fc1fccfe45605a384f743662&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13e723cb8b0af4bcf2f1b0fd37912cb2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9dc281a303d0d4c5300c0c1c45b739ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aeafa486bfd320cdaa7811ad75777912&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d61a5e7031ea811cc4dcc55a0a0e8fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c7418fb993bb3daa95d8563909da1de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-697db1653f51e966e79b92eefeb01ec6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67e9c4dc95841db7d0af39e1267ae71b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-975e540ddee1810d43caf8df4adcf205</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764560575</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
