      <data key="d0">Eligibility Criteria</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Rules regarding age, cancer type, stage, treatment history, and health required for participation in clinical trials.&lt;SEP&gt;Rules that specify who can participate in a clinical trial, based on age, cancer type, stage, treatment history, and health.&lt;SEP&gt;Rules regarding age, cancer stage, treatment history, and health, used to select appropriate participants for clinical trials.&lt;SEP&gt;Rules about age, cancer type and stage, treatment history, or general health that determine who can enroll in a clinical trial.&lt;SEP&gt;Eligibility criteria are rules for participation in clinical trials, such as age, cancer type, stage, and treatment history.&lt;SEP&gt;Rules for participation in a clinical trial, such as age, cancer stage, and health status.</data>
