      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Group of experts managing clinical trials, reviewing study details, risks, and benefits with patients.&lt;SEP&gt;A team that collects research data and coordinates care, especially in clinical trials for new therapies.&lt;SEP&gt;A group of experts managing and overseeing the conduct of a clinical trial.&lt;SEP&gt;A group of experts managing the clinical trial process, including reviewing study details and safety.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e90bcd28496f1f39a21973656e3e496f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-541f1323a24c5990b4a6408e0c5442ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c35816f05289661283f683145d9f395f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f6fd03791661f76f6c1a246b2074b2a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-725b48dc82aad42ba3dc14f4b5207551</data>
