    <node id="Informed Consent">
      <data key="d0">Informed Consent</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Process where patients review detailed information about a clinical trial, including risks and benefits, and give permission to participate.&lt;SEP&gt;A document confirming patients are fully informed about the risks, benefits, and procedures of a clinical trial.&lt;SEP&gt;Informed consent is a process and documentation in clinical trials where participants acknowledge understanding the risks, benefits, and procedures.&lt;SEP&gt;The process where patients receive detailed information about a clinical trial, including risks and benefits, and voluntarily agree to participate.&lt;SEP&gt;An informed consent form is a document that provides detailed information about a clinical trial, including its purpose, risks, and benefits.&lt;SEP&gt;A process where participants are informed about risks and benefits before joining a clinical trial.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-cd2be7a2ce722f07b19c80e6e1690a8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-541f1323a24c5990b4a6408e0c5442ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c35816f05289661283f683145d9f395f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-725b48dc82aad42ba3dc14f4b5207551&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ec4d44b145ca896ff1216caa90ce5dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f6fd03791661f76f6c1a246b2074b2a0</data>
