    <node id="Side Effects">
      <data key="d0">Side Effects</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Side effects refer to adverse effects that may occur as a result of cancer treatments, including systemic therapies such as chemotherapy, radiation therapy, and intravesical BCG therapy. These effects can range from mild to severe and encompass a variety of physical and emotional conditions that may cause discomfort or require management to minimize their impact.

Common side effects associated with systemic cancer treatments include fatigue, nausea, vomiting, diarrhea, mouth sores, hair loss, loss of appetite, and reduced blood cell counts, which increase susceptibility to infections and bleeding. Some treatments also have specific adverse effects; for instance, chemotherapy can lead to nerve damage and organ damage, while radiation therapy may cause skin irritation, skin redness or rash, difficulties swallowing, dry mouth, changes in taste, and long-term tissue changes that can become apparent years later. Intravesical BCG therapy may result in side effects such as fever, chills, urinary difficulties, and blood in the urine.

Additionally, radiation therapy can impact ovarian function and cause urinary issues and vaginal discharge. Other long-term or severe effects include the increased risk of secondary cancers, heart disease, kidney damage, tinnitus, hearing loss, and tissue changes that may develop years after treatment. Cancer itself may also cause adverse effects, and treatments can lead to emotional and physical conditions deemed unhealthy or unpleasant. Overall, side effects of cancer treatments necessitate careful management and monitoring to alleviate symptoms and prevent long-term health issues.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-68217ea9e5382d1756c99b5152ea98db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-541f1323a24c5990b4a6408e0c5442ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-419f40f64b13b1b2d0fac3cfb9fde92a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8fbedfa2d88a7b3852f4c2bd0bb64af0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a65ba958750476cc543741efe815c7c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d04ad65c55d0dbbee5061cf3b24030ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0a584e54ffa22e1c25f839302bcd727&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0fdcce851d69aa713ed64ba1895bd5d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f6fd03791661f76f6c1a246b2074b2a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db3a86fc5d439d9bfb3845e468a2a551&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c9bfa651267335dd5e6ae5a24d85a072&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9cc65c1c26b9e24bfb2c8c966f734a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b44f0b4da13a804cd1dfb917ac7e981&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd2be7a2ce722f07b19c80e6e1690a8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c35816f05289661283f683145d9f395f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37bca9f4d2ebaeed359c9b4eb7a0c1de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1c1687a8a20b9c451956cf8bba241cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-725b48dc82aad42ba3dc14f4b5207551</data>
