      <data key="d1">other</data>
      <data key="d2">A side effect where urine leaks unexpectedly, common after bladder cancer treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;Urinary incontinence is a condition characterized by trouble controlling the flow of urine, often resulting in urine leakage unexpectedly.</data>
