      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The clinicaltrials.gov database contains listings of clinical trials available in the United States and worldwide.&lt;SEP&gt;Database of privately and publicly funded clinical studies conducted worldwide.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-541f1323a24c5990b4a6408e0c5442ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d4cea71149e0e4157126efdaa0ea3e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ec4d44b145ca896ff1216caa90ce5dd</data>
