    <node id="Human Papillomavirus">
      <data key="d0">Human Papillomavirus</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Human papillomavirus (HPV) is a group of viruses linked to infection and some types of cancer, especially in the head, neck, and throat.&lt;SEP&gt;HPV is a sexually transmitted virus strongly linked with anal cancer and other related cancers.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ea7b3f83164304ee4a562046eb0f5033&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d249262ff9e7e657de99a30199159cdf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2a44e885faf856aa579d824b3cd85e7</data>
