    <node id="HPV Infection">
      <data key="d0">HPV Infection</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">HPV infection can cause abnormal tissue growth and HPV-related cancers, including throat cancers.&lt;SEP&gt;HPV infection is caused by human papillomavirus, a common STI that can lead to cervical cancer and other cancers, with certain high-risk strains like HPV16.&lt;SEP&gt;Infection with HPV can cause abnormal skin growths called warts and is linked to the development of anal and other cancers.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9530f389987c13273449ab22a85170ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5fa7c7369d88ae71c842152510867223&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b4d036ee5fd77783b9e7ddef3a8477ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d249262ff9e7e657de99a30199159cdf</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764560583</data>
