    <node id="Self-Advocacy">
      <data key="d0">Self-Advocacy</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Patients are encouraged to actively participate in their care, ask questions, and make shared decisions.&lt;SEP&gt;Patients are encouraged to advocate for themselves by asking questions and sharing decisions with their care team to improve care outcomes.&lt;SEP&gt;Patients should communicate clearly with doctors if they do not understand medical information.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ef6586b896c47b361bf4f6aabb4c35d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d67bee20d5e5400994f8c8f03052dd06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-29c9b8b5fd2cd967c48522af79a9598f</data>
