    <node id="Risk Assessment">
      <data key="d0">Risk Assessment</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Risk assessment involves evaluating factors like genetics, tumor characteristics, and biomarkers to determine prostate cancer prognosis.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-789ec6c06f8c999ac21c89b085b3fdb7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-60426652ddf8265bf75caba550026d38&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5fdcf47f3da06d3e0213112c96eb93d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5846f51c2ca4fae54459ce9c50e3e820&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb36cedd3f66584d65304e58b668eeab</data>
