    <node id="Prostate-Specific Antigen (PSA)">
      <data key="d0">Prostate-Specific Antigen (PSA)</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">PSA is a protein produced by the prostate gland, used as a biomarker in blood tests for prostate health and cancer risk assessment.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9dc281a303d0d4c5300c0c1c45b739ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-789ec6c06f8c999ac21c89b085b3fdb7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d61a5e7031ea811cc4dcc55a0a0e8fa</data>
