      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Cancer stage determined after surgery by examining removed tissue.&lt;SEP&gt;Pathologic or surgical stage (p) is determined after examining surgically removed tissue.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-28e4e845dfd1390f7f94cfb11bee1526&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d388da75afb5ea2d01c97e55cb2b872&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f05c8ea6f7c7b4ba1fb0ff1c1733980&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb41559e96b71d2bb4ea207c806e8d5f</data>
