      <data key="d0">Ductal Carcinoma in Situ</data>
      <data key="d1">other</data>
      <data key="d2">Ductal carcinoma in situ (DCIS) is a noninvasive form of breast cancer confined to the ducts.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-cb41559e96b71d2bb4ea207c806e8d5f</data>
