      <data key="d2">Tumor size and extent are key components in cancer staging.&lt;SEP&gt;The tumor component assesses the size and extent of the primary tumor.&lt;SEP&gt;Tumor size is a crucial factor in cancer staging, measured in centimeters.</data>
      <data key="d1">UNKNOWN</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764560762</data>
      <data key="d6" />
