      <data key="d2">PET scans detect cancer cells by visualizing areas of increased glucose usage with radioactive tracers, appearing as bright spots.&lt;SEP&gt;PET highlights cancerous cells based on their increased metabolic activity and is used to detect metastasis.</data>
