    <node id="Hereditary Syndromes">
      <data key="d0">Hereditary Syndromes</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-18b5e32980f3efa0cd012e2abab9b9fc</data>
      <data key="d2">Syndromes such as FAP, Carney complex, and MEN increase the risk of developing thyroid cancer.</data>
      <data key="d1">UNKNOWN</data>
