      <data key="d2">Chemotherapy may be used when cancer has spread to areas far from the thyroid or other primary sites, especially for aggressive cancers.&lt;SEP&gt;Chemotherapy is used for thyroid cancer that has spread to distant areas, especially when resistant to other treatments.</data>
