    <edge source="Treatment" target="Biomarkers">
      <data key="d7">2.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Biomarkers such as BRCA mutations, HRD, HER2, MSI, MMR, TMB, BRAF V600E, FRα, RET, and NTRK influence targeted therapy and immunotherapy choices.&lt;SEP&gt;Biomarkers are tested in tumor tissue to help select the most appropriate therapy.</data>
