      <data key="d7">2.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Cancer treatments can impact fertility; patients should discuss concerns with their care team, especially when planning pregnancy.&lt;SEP&gt;Certain bone cancer treatments can affect fertility; patients should seek advice from fertility specialists before starting treatment.</data>
