    <edge source="Treatment" target="Bladder Cancer">
      <data key="d7">3.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Bladder cancer can be treated with surgery, chemotherapy, immunotherapy, radiation, or targeted therapy, alone or combined.&lt;SEP&gt;Treatment approaches are chosen based on the stage and extent of cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Various treatment options aim to manage or eradicate bladder cancer, tailored to stage, grade, and patient factors.</data>
