    <edge source="Treatment" target="Cancer">
      <data key="d7">2.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Cancer is managed through various treatments depending on cancer type and stage.&lt;SEP&gt;Different stages of bladder cancer require specific treatment approaches, including surgery, chemotherapy, immunotherapy, and radiation.</data>
      <data key="d9">management,therapy</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-68217ea9e5382d1756c99b5152ea98db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ec4d44b145ca896ff1216caa90ce5dd</data>
      <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
