    </edge>
    <edge source="Treatment" target="Chemotherapy">
      <data key="d7">2.0</data>
      <data key="d8">A primary method of treatment involving drug therapy.&lt;SEP&gt;Different chemotherapy regimens like mitomycin with capecitabine, 5-FU with cisplatin, are used alongside radiation therapy for anal cancer.</data>
      <data key="d9">primary CNS lymphoma,regimen</data>
