    <edge source="Fertility" target="Cancer Treatment">
      <data key="d7">6.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Cancer and its treatment may temporarily or permanently impair fertility.&lt;SEP&gt;Cancer treatments can influence fertility, and fertility preservation options are available.&lt;SEP&gt;Cancer treatments may impair fertility, so options for preservation should be discussed before starting therapy.&lt;SEP&gt;Cancer treatments like chemotherapy can impair fertility temporarily or permanently.&lt;SEP&gt;Cancer treatment such as chemotherapy can affect fertility, and options for preservation should be discussed.&lt;SEP&gt;Cancer treatments may impact fertility; discussing preservation options before therapy is recommended.</data>
