    <edge source="Fertility" target="Fertility Preservation">
      <data key="d7">5.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Actions or procedures taken to preserve reproductive potential before starting cancer treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;Fertility preservation involves measures taken to retain reproductive ability before cancer treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;Fertility preservation is a proactive measure to maintain reproductive potential before cancer treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;Fertility preservation is a process to help maintain reproductive ability before cancer treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;Collecting and freezing sperm or eggs can preserve fertility during cancer treatment.</data>
      <data key="d9">concept,method,methods,option,options,reproductive options,reproductive prospects</data>
