    <edge source="Cancer" target="Imaging">
      <data key="d7">4.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Imaging techniques visualize internal tissues to identify cancer and its spread.&lt;SEP&gt;Imaging scans help determine the extent, spread, and localization of cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Determining the stage of cancer based on the extent of tumor, lymph node involvement, and metastasis.&lt;SEP&gt;Imaging techniques help locate, characterize, and determine the spread of cancer within urinary organs.</data>
