      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
    <edge source="Cancer" target="Progression">
      <data key="d7">3.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Cancer in the prostate can invade surrounding tissues and metastasize.&lt;SEP&gt;From local tumors (Stage 1A) to metastatic spread (Stage 4B).&lt;SEP&gt;Cancer progression is described in stages based on how far and fast the cancer has grown/spread.</data>
      <data key="d9">can,follows,growth,spread</data>
