    <edge source="Cancer" target="Distant Organs">
      <data key="d7">2.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The M category indicates whether the cancer has spread to distant sites like the liver or lungs.&lt;SEP&gt;Distant metastasis involving organs such as liver or lungs.</data>
      <data key="d9">Returns to,metastasis</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-a18089523f6dcd63cfa5664dc1c01618&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-29b3a349650a8bb55b318dcc6ecb0519</data>
