    <edge source="Cancer" target="Surgery">
      <data key="d7">3.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Surgery may not be possible if it is too risky or cannot fully remove the cancer; in such cases, immunotherapy is considered.&lt;SEP&gt;Surgery is the primary method to treat primary or regional skin cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Surgical removal of ovaries, fallopian tubes, uterus, omentum, and lymph nodes aims to treat ovarian cancer.</data>
      <data key="d9">treatment,treats</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-cf2d987135a5936876bc819136e3a5b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64895edc4d35c98b293c555e32022a37&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50c5e5d6c7a62da56b73abb9a3384301</data>
