    </edge>
    <edge source="Cancer" target="Chemotherapy">
      <data key="d7">3.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Chemotherapy uses drugs like cisplatin and carboplatin to kill rapidly dividing cancer cells.&lt;SEP&gt;Chemotherapy can be administered before surgery to shrink ovarian tumors.&lt;SEP&gt;Chemotherapy is used to kill cancer cells, but also harms blood and stem cells, leading to the need for rescue.</data>
      <data key="d9">shrinking,treatment</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-cf2d987135a5936876bc819136e3a5b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d609bd1a55d409470c55ad55e2d125d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9cc65c1c26b9e24bfb2c8c966f734a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e8b25c2957355218780bdfd8b72df45</data>
