    <edge source="Cancer" target="Prostate">
      <data key="d7">6.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Prostate cancer is a common cancer arising from the prostate gland, influenced by age, genetics, race, and lifestyle.&lt;SEP&gt;Prostate is the site of cancer development and is evaluated using multiple imaging methods and biopsy.&lt;SEP&gt;The prostate can develop cancer, which may be diagnosed via biopsy and genetic testing.&lt;SEP&gt;Cancer in the prostate can spread outside the gland and invade other tissues.&lt;SEP&gt;Uncontrolled growth of cells in the prostate.&lt;SEP&gt;Prostate cancer is a malignant tumor occurring within the prostate gland.</data>
      <data key="d9">can,disease,involves,location</data>
