    <edge source="Cancer" target="Breast">
      <data key="d7">2.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Breast cancer often begins in the ducts or lobules and can spread into surrounding tissues.&lt;SEP&gt;Breast cancer develops within the breast tissue, primarily in ducts or lobules, and can invade surrounding tissues.</data>
      <data key="d9">disease,location,pathogenesis</data>
