    </edge>
    <edge source="Cancer" target="Hormones">
      <data key="d7">1.0</data>
      <data key="d8">High doses of hormones like ethinyl estradiol, fluoxymesterone, and megestrol acetate can be used to treat breast cancer.</data>
      <data key="d9">Treatment</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-e45947107c74d8a06e350be57a94a408</data>
      <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d12">1764561023</data>
      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
    <edge source="Cancer" target="CT">
      <data key="d7">1.0</data>
      <data key="d8">CT scans provide detailed images to find cancer spread in the chest, abdomen, and pelvis.</data>
      <data key="d9">detection</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-50531346164ea7c08dd087a868b3cc2a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fba176235a4410ba8723447134c92579</data>
      <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d12">1764561032</data>
      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
    <edge source="Cancer" target="Systemic Therapy">
      <data key="d7">4.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Systemic therapy involves medication that can affect cells throughout the body, used in cancer treatment such as chemotherapy.&lt;SEP&gt;Systemic therapy is used to treat metastasis or when surgery and radiation are not options.&lt;SEP&gt;Treatments like chemotherapy or immunotherapy that address cancer throughout the entire body.&lt;SEP&gt;Systemic therapy involves substances like chemotherapy, targeted therapy, and immunotherapy that affect cells throughout the body.</data>
      <data key="d9">treatment,treats</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-a9d0006f1c78fe4fa7bb74b756033104&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64895edc4d35c98b293c555e32022a37&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9cc65c1c26b9e24bfb2c8c966f734a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd2be7a2ce722f07b19c80e6e1690a8e</data>
