    <edge source="Cancer" target="Immunotherapy">
      <data key="d7">3.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Immunotherapy with cemiplimab-rwlc may be used to shrink tumors and make surgery less risky when surgery is not an option.&lt;SEP&gt;Immunotherapy with immune checkpoint inhibitors is a preferred systemic therapy for eligible patients.&lt;SEP&gt;Immunotherapy, involving checkpoint inhibitors, is used before surgery in certain cancers with dMMR/MSI-H status.</data>
      <data key="d9">alternative treatment,therapy,treats</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-c1c1687a8a20b9c451956cf8bba241cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64895edc4d35c98b293c555e32022a37&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50c5e5d6c7a62da56b73abb9a3384301</data>
