    </edge>
    <edge source="Cancer" target="Radiation Therapy">
      <data key="d7">3.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Radiation therapy is used to treat cancers like CSCC, either as primary or adjuvant therapy.&lt;SEP&gt;Radiation therapy is used to kill residual cancer cells after surgery or as treatment when surgery isn't feasible.&lt;SEP&gt;Radiation therapy is used to kill cancer cells, shrink tumors, and manage cancer-related pain.</data>
      <data key="d9">target,treatment</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-64895edc4d35c98b293c555e32022a37&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9cc65c1c26b9e24bfb2c8c966f734a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd2be7a2ce722f07b19c80e6e1690a8e</data>
