    <edge source="Blood" target="Blood Cells">
      <data key="d7">4.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Blood consists of plasma, red blood cells, white blood cells, and platelets, which perform various functions.&lt;SEP&gt;Red blood cells, white blood cells, and platelets are the main blood components derived from blood stem cells.&lt;SEP&gt;Blood is a tissue composed of various blood cells performing oxygen transport, immune defense, and clotting.&lt;SEP&gt;Blood cells perform functions such as oxygen transport, immune response, and blood clotting.</data>
      <data key="d9">components,composition,function,perform</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-bd7ea43a74059d6781866faec437f19a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a99a89bec88823cedf4c1f0cd1a78e81&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2dc31077c053f79ff82959575d335956</data>
