    </edge>
    <edge source="Blood" target="AML">
      <data key="d7">3.0</data>
      <data key="d8">AML is a type of blood cancer affecting white blood cell development.&lt;SEP&gt;AML starts in blood stem cells in the bone marrow, leading to the proliferation of abnormal myeloblasts.&lt;SEP&gt;AML originates in blood stem cells within the bone marrow, leading to abnormal proliferation of myeloblasts.</data>
      <data key="d9">blood cancer,disease,origin</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-bd7ea43a74059d6781866faec437f19a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d9882c04dd7676c6433074e5e393c72e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2dc31077c053f79ff82959575d335956</data>
