    </edge>
    <edge source="Blood" target="Bone Marrow">
      <data key="d7">3.0</data>
      <data key="d8">In AML, more than 20% of cells in bone marrow or blood are myeloblasts, confirming diagnosis.&lt;SEP&gt;Blood cells, including lymphocytes, are produced in the bone marrow.&lt;SEP&gt;Blood cells are produced in the bone marrow from hematopoietic stem cells.</data>
