      <data key="d8">Maintenance therapy is used after initial treatment to lower recurrence risk or prolong remission.&lt;SEP&gt;Maintenance therapy options, including PARP inhibitors and bevacizumab, are considered after initial treatment success.&lt;SEP&gt;Maintenance therapy aims to lower recurrence risk or extend progression-free survival in ovarian cancer.</data>
