    <edge source="Chemotherapy" target="Cisplatin">
      <data key="d7">4.0</data>
      <data key="d8">A platinum-based drug used in ovarian cancer treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;A platinum-based drug used in weekly cycles during chemoradiation, known to cause kidney damage, tinnitus, and hearing loss.&lt;SEP&gt;Cisplatin is a platinum-based chemotherapy drug used to treat bladder cancer but can damage kidneys.&lt;SEP&gt;Cisplatin is administered intravenously during chemotherapy regimens for anal cancer, combined with 5-FU.</data>
      <data key="d9">Drug,drug,metal,method,platinum</data>
