    <edge source="Chemotherapy" target="Systemic Therapy">
      <data key="d7">6.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Chemotherapy uses drugs, including platinum-based compounds like cisplatin and carboplatin, to kill cancer cells.&lt;SEP&gt;Uses drugs to destroy cancer cells, often in advanced or unresectable cancers.&lt;SEP&gt;Chemotherapy is a form of systemic therapy used to reduce tumor burden before or after surgery.&lt;SEP&gt;Chemotherapy is a type of systemic therapy that works throughout the body.&lt;SEP&gt;Administered intravenously, with cycles allowing recovery, to kill or inhibit cancer cell growth.&lt;SEP&gt;Chemotherapy can be administered systemically to treat bladder cancer affecting the entire body.</data>
      <data key="d9">Method,category,chemotherapy,treatment</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-cd2be7a2ce722f07b19c80e6e1690a8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0a584e54ffa22e1c25f839302bcd727&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f6fd03791661f76f6c1a246b2074b2a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0bad5ee25cb854c10bdbc9d33b54a1a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8333423c91919d7adde114b8286cca7e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e90bcd28496f1f39a21973656e3e496f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1c1687a8a20b9c451956cf8bba241cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9040f5949ae0ff36ce88faa1f4b67ead&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e45947107c74d8a06e350be57a94a408&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a9d0006f1c78fe4fa7bb74b756033104&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d04ad65c55d0dbbee5061cf3b24030ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9cc65c1c26b9e24bfb2c8c966f734a0</data>
      <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d12">1764560846</data>
      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
