    <edge source="Chemotherapy" target="Side Effects">
      <data key="d7">6.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Chemotherapy side effects include nausea, hair loss, fatigue, infection risk, nerve damage, and others.&lt;SEP&gt;Chemotherapy drugs like oxaliplatin and irinotecan cause specific side effects during treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;Chemotherapy can cause nausea, vomiting, diarrhea, mouth sores, hair loss, low blood cell counts, kidney failure.&lt;SEP&gt;Chemotherapy can cause side effects such as hair loss, cracked skin, mouth sores, nausea, and vomiting.&lt;SEP&gt;Chemotherapy can cause nausea, vomiting, fatigue, and other health issues.&lt;SEP&gt;Common side effects of chemotherapy include nausea, vomiting, diarrhea, hair loss, and sores.</data>
      <data key="d9">abdominal cramping,adverse effects,chemotherapy,diarrhea,fatigue,hair loss,nausea,nerve damage</data>
