    <edge source="Radiation Therapy" target="Side Effects">
      <data key="d7">3.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Skin redness, itching, discomfort, tissue hardening, skin color changes, and more serious long-term effects can result from radiation.&lt;SEP&gt;Common side effects include headaches, nausea, vomiting, loss of appetite, fatigue, and long-term cognitive issues.&lt;SEP&gt;Radiation therapy can cause skin rash, redness, swallowing problems, dry mouth, taste changes, tiredness, and long-term health issues.</data>
      <data key="d9">adverse effects</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-a65ba958750476cc543741efe815c7c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8fbedfa2d88a7b3852f4c2bd0bb64af0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9cc65c1c26b9e24bfb2c8c966f734a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd2be7a2ce722f07b19c80e6e1690a8e</data>
