      <data key="d7">2.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Radiation therapy is used to treat primary CNS lymphoma, especially when chemotherapy is not suitable.&lt;SEP&gt;Radiation therapy is used to treat primary CNS lymphoma, including the eyes, with considerations for side effects like vision problems.</data>
