    <edge source="Bone Marrow" target="AML">
      <data key="d7">4.0</data>
      <data key="d8">AML originates in the bone marrow, disrupting normal blood cell production.&lt;SEP&gt;AML is diagnosed through bone marrow aspirate and biopsy, with blasts exceeding specific thresholds.&lt;SEP&gt;Diagnosis of AML involves bone marrow aspirate and biopsy, which reveal myeloblasts.&lt;SEP&gt;Bone marrow analysis is crucial for AML diagnosis, especially the presence of myeloid blasts.</data>
