    <edge source="Bone Marrow" target="Lymphoblasts">
      <data key="d7">2.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Lymphoblasts are immature lymphocytes produced in bone marrow that multiply abnormally in ALL.&lt;SEP&gt;Detection of lymphoblasts in bone marrow is key for diagnosing ALL.</data>
