    </edge>
    <edge source="Bladder Cancer" target="Cigarette Smoking">
      <data key="d7">2.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Smoking introduces carcinogens that significantly increase the risk of developing bladder cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Smoking or vaping increases the risk of bladder cancer and can influence treatment outcomes.</data>
      <data key="d9">risk factor,risk_increase</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-68217ea9e5382d1756c99b5152ea98db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a890e27eba8c63d10f19b85a72fc14a</data>
