    <edge source="Bladder Cancer" target="Intravesical Therapy">
      <data key="d7">2.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Involves filling the bladder with medication to target cancer cells.&lt;SEP&gt;Intravesical therapy involves direct drug placement into the bladder.</data>
