    <edge source="Blood Stem Cells" target="Progenitor Cells">
      <data key="d7">2.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Blood stem cells develop into progenitor cells, which then differentiate into specific blood cell types.&lt;SEP&gt;Blood stem cells differentiate into progenitor cells which develop into various blood cells.</data>
      <data key="d9">blood cell formation,development,differentiation</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-8b66e38931f28ed6ac9b231faaf202fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a99a89bec88823cedf4c1f0cd1a78e81</data>
