    </edge>
    <edge source="Airways" target="Lungs">
      <data key="d7">1.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Airways are a series of structures through which air moves into the lungs, including the windpipe, bronchi, and bronchioli.</data>
      <data key="d9">pathways,respiration</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-bd06bc83e13e7562ce65d6eee1b6024f</data>
