    <edge source="Adrenal Gland Cancer" target="Adrenal Glands">
      <data key="d7">1.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Adrenal gland cancer begins in the adrenal cortex or medulla within the adrenal glands, affecting hormone production and pressing on nearby organs.</data>
