    </edge>
    <edge source="Cervical Cancer" target="Cervical Dysplasia">
      <data key="d7">2.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Cervical dysplasia, especially high-grade lesions (HSIL), can progress to cervical cancer if untreated.&lt;SEP&gt;Cervical dysplasia, especially high-grade lesions, can progress to invasive cervical cancer if not treated.</data>
      <data key="d9">precursor,progression</data>
