    </edge>
    <edge source="Cervical Cancer" target="FIGO System">
      <data key="d7">2.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The FIGO system is used to stage cervical cancer with stages I to IV and sub-stages based on tumor size and spread.&lt;SEP&gt;Standardized staging of cervical cancer based on tumor size, extent, and lymph node involvement.</data>
      <data key="d9">stages,used for</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-db3a86fc5d439d9bfb3845e468a2a551&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9a7fe3b15f3289198c7114b44890dea</data>
