      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
    <edge source="Adenoma" target="Aldosteronoma">
      <data key="d7">1.0</data>
      <data key="d8">An adenoma producing excess aldosterone is called an aldosteronoma, which affects hormone balance and blood pressure.</data>
      <data key="d9">hormone excess,tumor</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-f8eae4d6dadf6a6fbd339efa4dec2172</data>
      <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d12">1764560953</data>
      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
    <edge source="Adenoma" target="Polyp">
      <data key="d7">1.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Adenomas are the most common type of polyps that can transform into invasive cancer.</data>
